  "body": "Currently we state \"Non-browser user agents are not required to support this API.\"\r\n\r\nI wonder if we should phrase that differently somehow to be inclusive of other JavaScript deployments, such as Node.js. @jasnell thoughts? I'm guessing Node.js has its own encoding libraries, but maybe this is another place where we can pursue convergence.",
